href=\"https://github.com/o/r/blob/abc/tests/test_a.py#L15\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/o/r/main/dokima/icons/verified-by.svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"verified by\"> Verified by</a>: Nothing else changes.*\n\n</details>\n\n**Scope:** `dokima/card.py`\n\n<details><summary><b>Out of scope</b></summary>\n\n- The `--x <y>` flag &amp; &lt;kbd&gt;evil&lt;/kbd&gt; &amp; &lt;img src=\"x.png\" alt=\"evil\"&gt;.\n- An open fence ``` &lt;kbd&gt;fence&lt;/kbd&gt;\n\n</details>\n\n**Definition of Done:** <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/o/r/main/dokima/icons/none.svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"not started\"> All tests · <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/o/r/main/dokima/icons/none.svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"not started\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/o/r/main/dokima/icons/code-review.svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"code review\"> Code review · <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/o/r/main/dokima/icons/none.svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"not started\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/o/r/main/dokima/icons/owner-approval.svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"owner approval\"> Owner approval\n\n<!-- /dokima-card -->",
   "html": "\n<p>Run <code class=\"notranslate\">a &lt; b &amp;&amp; c &gt; d</code> first, while &lt;kbd&gt;evil&lt;/kbd&gt; &amp; &lt;img src=\"x.png\" alt=\"evil\"&gt; stays text.</p>\n<p><strong>Plan</strong></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/o/r/issues/456\">https://github.com/o/r/issues/456</a></p>\n<p><strong>User story:</strong> Owners read <code class=\"notranslate\">&lt;T&gt; &amp; U</code> as written.</p>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/o/r/main/dokima/icons/acceptance-criterion.svg\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/o/r/main/dokima/icons/acceptance-criterion.svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"acceptance criterion\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; max-height: 16px;; aspect-ratio: 16 / 16; background-color: var(--bgColor-muted); border-radius: 6px\" class=\"js-gh-image-fallback\"></a> <strong>Acceptance criteria</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/o/r/main/dokima/icons/none.svg\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/o/r/main/dokima/icons/none.svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"not started\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; max-height: 16px;; aspect-ratio: 16 / 16; background-color: var(--bgColor-muted); border-radius: 6px\" class=\"js-gh-image-fallback\"></a> <strong>Acceptance criterion:</strong> The check runs this:\n<pre class=\"notranslate\"><code class=\"notranslate\">if a &lt; b &amp;&amp; c &gt; d:\n    print('&lt;ok&gt; &amp; done')\n</code></pre>\nwhile &lt;kbd&gt;evil&lt;/kbd&gt; &amp; &lt;img src=\"x.png\" alt=\"evil\"&gt; stays text.\n<ul>\n<li><em><a href=\"https://github.com/o/r/blob/abc/tests/test_a.py#L3\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/o/r/main/dokima/icons/verified-by.svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"verified by\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; max-heigh